<title>USA: El Salvador passes on U.S. soymeal tender - USDA.</title>
<headline>El Salvador passes on U.S. soymeal tender - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador passed on its tender for 8,000 to 10,000 tonnes of PL-480 soybean meal for May 7-22 shipment, a spokesman for the PL-480 operations division, U.S. Department of Agriculture, said.</p>
<p>The tender was slated for April 28.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
